---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const schema = [];
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and Conditions | Word Hunt Solver"
  description="The terms for using wordhuntsolvers.com, including the free Word Hunt Solver and Board Evolver, word list accuracy, and trademarks."
  path="/terms-and-conditions"
  schema={schema}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-14 pt-6 sm:px-6 sm:pt-10">
    <header id="top" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-[1.15] text-headline dark:text-headline-dark sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem]">Terms and Conditions</h1>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Last updated: October 6, 2026</p>
    </header>
    <section id="acceptance-of-terms" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Acceptance of Terms</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">By using wordhuntsolvers.com, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
</section>
<section id="using-the-tools" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Using the Tools</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">The Word Hunt Solver and Board Evolver are free for personal use, to help you solve word puzzles faster. You may not use automated systems to scrape the site or to send it more traffic than a normal visitor would.</p>
</section>
<section id="content-and-trademarks" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Content and Trademarks</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">The site design, code, images, and written content belong to wordhuntsolvers.com. The ENABLE word list that powers the tools is in the public domain and is not owned by us. GamePigeon, Apple, iMessage, Boggle, and Scrabble are trademarks of their owners. This site is independent and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of them.</p>
</section>
<section id="no-guarantee-of-accuracy" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">No Guarantee of Accuracy</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Results come from the ENABLE word list. GamePigeon uses its own word list, so the game may not accept every word the tools show, and it may accept words the tools do not show. Use the results as a guide, not a guaranteed answer.</p>
</section>
<section id="prohibited-use" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Prohibited Use</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">You may not use this site for any illegal purpose or try to disrupt how it works.</p>
</section>
<section id="limitation-of-liability" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Limitation of Liability</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">The site is provided as is, without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any loss or damage that comes from using the site.</p>
</section>
<section id="changes-to-these-terms" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Changes to These Terms</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We may update these terms. If we do, we will change the date at the top of this page. Using the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>
</section>
<section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-24 py-7 sm:py-9">
<div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="section-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-10 6L2 7"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Contact</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Questions about these terms? Reach us through our <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">contact page</a>.</p>
</section>
  </article>
</Layout>
